# TLS front-door snippet. Append to the Caddy that terminates HTTPS.
# On this fleet that host is node-gateway (198.51.100.20). It proxies to
# node-primary's public HTTP port. Caddy obtains the certificate once DNS for
# the name points at this machine.
# Do not replace a live Caddyfile with this fragment.

nightcal.example.org {
	import privacy
	encode gzip
	reverse_proxy 203.0.113.10:80 {
		header_up X-Forwarded-For {remote_host}
	}
}
